  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Council meeting of Institutions Innovation Council</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru has organized a Council meeting of Institutions Innovation Council for reviewing the activities conducted in Quarter 1 and 2. And also to review the progress of Quarter 3 and 4 for the current academic semester. Dr. Rathnakar G, President, IIC – ATEMECE, conducted the meeting in the presence of IIC Faculty and Student Co-ordinators.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
